      "message_parsed": "Хостер ничем помочь неможет смотрите логи разберайтесь и все вот кусок лог файла:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">150329 14:18:26 [Warning] /usr/sbin/mysqld: Forcing close of thread 419 user: &#039;user&#039;\n150329 14:18:26 [Note] /usr/sbin/mysqld: Shutdown complete\n150329 14:19:08 [Warning] ignore-builtin-innodb is deprecated and will be removed in future releases.\n150329 14:19:08 [Warning] Using unique option prefix myisam-recover instead of myisam-recover-options is deprecated and will be removed in a future release. Please use the full name instead.\n150329 14:19:08 [Note] Plugin &#039;FEDERATED&#039; is disabled.\n150329 14:19:09 [Note] Server hostname (bind-address): &#039;0.0.0.0&#039;; port: 3306\n150329 14:19:09 [Note] - &#039;0.0.0.0&#039; resolves to &#039;0.0.0.0&#039;;\n150329 14:19:09 [Note] Server socket created on IP: &#039;0.0.0.0&#039;.\n150329 14:23:24 [Note] Event Scheduler: Loaded 0 events\n150329 14:23:24 [Note] /usr/sbin/mysqld: ready for connections.\nVersion: &#039;5.5.41-0ubuntu0.12.04.1&#039; socket: &#039;/var/run/mysqld/mysqld.sock&#039; port: 3306 (Ubuntu)\n150329 15:45:33 [Warning] IP address &#039;104.233.142.199&#039; could not be resolved: Name or service not known</pre>Граббер отключил, ошибка так и выскакивает периодически.",
